{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557060/extras/5ed38f4832fe53aaaac1175af3f10dea.avif?t=1772175113\" alt=\"Building image\" width=1152 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The building has been endlessly expanded and rebuilt, twisting into something so distorted that no one can grasp its full shape.<br>It was once a clinic, but now it only swells and shifts, changing its form without end.<br>A young girl, carrying an infant she discovered inside, gropes her way through the darkness in search of an escape.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a horror adventure game. Explore the chaotic, ever-growing structure and lead the girl and the baby out of this uncanny place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557060/extras/88ddefe10d1037b687898905b69b0750.poster.avif?t=1772175113\" aria-label=\"Game play movie\" width=1152 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557060/extras/88ddefe10d1037b687898905b69b0750.webm?t=1772175113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players control the girl as she explores dark and eerie corridors and rooms, solving environmental puzzles and overcoming obstacles along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tension of fleeing from pursuers, the thrill of sneaking through the shadows, and the unique pressure of protecting the baby together define the core experience of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3557060?t=1772175113","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3557060?t=1772175113","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557060/9f4e723dff5a98268f840e2ff3c56f452e23e0cc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772175113","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557060/9f4e723dff5a98268f840e2ff3c56f452e23e0cc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772175113","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4370700,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557060/extras/5ed38f4832fe53aaaac1175af3f10dea.avif?t=1772175113\" alt=\"Building image\" width=1152 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The building has been endlessly expanded and rebuilt, twisting into something so distorted that no one can grasp its full shape.<br>It was once a clinic, but now it only swells and shifts, changing its form without end.<br>A young girl, carrying an infant she discovered inside, gropes her way through the darkness in search of an escape.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a horror adventure game. Explore the chaotic, ever-growing structure and lead the girl and the baby out of this uncanny place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/355706